msgid "Skissa cannot launch the gmic-qt plugin. No bundled library found."
msgstr "Skissa ne more zagnati vstavka gmic-qt. Nobene knjižnice ni mogoče najti."

msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The image contains pixels with zero alpha channel and non-zero color channels. Skissa has modified those pixels to have at least some alpha. The initial values will <i>not</i> be reverted on saving the image back.<br/><br/>This will hardly make any visual difference just keep it in mind."
msgstr "Slika vsebuje slikovne točke z ničelnim kanalom alfa in neničelnimi barvnimi kanali. Skissa je spremenila te slikovne točke, da imajo vsaj nekaj alfe. Začetne vrednosti se <i>ne</i> bodo povrnile pri shranjevanju slike.<br/><br/>To ne bo vplivalo na izgled, samo zavedajte se tega."

msgctxt "@tooltip"
msgid "The image will be linearized first, and then encoded with SMPTE ST 428. Skissa always opens images like these as linear floating point, this option is there to reverse that"
msgstr "Slika bo najprej linearizirana, nato pa kodirana s SMPTE ST 428. Skissa vedno odpira slike, kot je ta, kot z linearno plavajočo vejico, ta možnost je tam, da to preobrne"

msgid "The file is too new for this version of Skissa (%1)."
msgstr "Datoteka je preveč nova za to različico programa Skissa (%1)."

