msgid "Skissa was built without the support of GNU Scientific Library, so you cannot scale the selection with handles. Please compile Skissa with GNU Scientific Library support, or use options widget for editing scale values manually."
msgstr "Žal je bila Skissa zgrajena brez podpore knjižnice GNU Scientific Library, tako da ne morete spremeniti merila izbora z ročicami. Krito prevedite s podporo za knjižnico GNU Scientific Library ali pa uporabite možnosti gradnika za urejanje vrednosti spremembe merila ročno."

